    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Aeronativus hydra.</em> A four-headed living storm — each head is a different wind (Electric, Freezing, Maddening, Thunderous) that can be dissipated and regrown as the tempest rages. Its lair is the Eye of the Storm; the playful <strong>Meowsoon</strong> familiar (Tamer companion with a full improvement tree) is detailed in the same Field Notes PDF. Habitat: Arctic &amp; Ocean.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes X-35 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
        "public": ""
