      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The draconimbus can enter an enemy's space and stop there. It can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide without squeezing. When it enters an enemy's space for the first time on a turn, that creature is subject to the following effect. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 20 Dexterity. <em>Failure:</em> 10 (4d4) Lightning damage, and the target is knocked Prone. <em>Failure by 5 or More:</em> The target is Grappled (escape DC 20) inside the body of the draconimbus. While Grappled in this way, the target takes 5 (2d4) Lightning damage at the start of each of the draconimbus' turns.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
